---
# Example project-level config for sci-audit.
# Copy to `.claude/sci-audit.local.md` at your project root and edit.
# The hooks read this frontmatter; absent file => safe defaults below.

hooks_enabled: true           # Master switch: false silences ALL sci-audit hooks
                              # for this project (skills + MCP stay active). Use
                              # where the host repo ships its own hook layer.
                              # Env override: SCI_AUDIT_HOOKS=off
lang: auto                    # auto (detect) | tr | en
gate_unsourced_numeric: true  # Stop-gate (a): block unsourced quantitative claims
gate_tr_pvalue_dot: true      # Stop-gate (b): block English decimal-dot p-values in Turkish text
---

# sci-audit local config

Body is free-form notes; only the YAML frontmatter above is read by hooks.
Add project-specific reviewer notes here if you like — they are not parsed.
